OL,3,GNEWSAMarket Hall manager steps down
OL,4,Aamid criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe manager of Derby's Market Hall has
OL,7,Fstepped down from the role weeks after
OL,8,Fa damning report into its first year in
OL,9,Foperation.
OL,11,FHana York had managed the venue since
OL,12,Fit reopened in May 2025 after a #35m
OL,13,Frestoration.
OL,15,FShe is understood to have resigned from
OL,16,Fthe position shortly after an internal
OL,17,Fcouncil review was published earlier
OL,18,Fthis month, which found the Market Hall
OL,19,Fhad no "clear commercial objectives"
OL,20,Fand no proper marketing plan when it
OL,21,Freopened to the public.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
